## 3. COMPREHENSIVE MODULE BREAKDOWN

### Module 1: 3-Role Haulage Transaction, Dispatch & Bypassing-Protection Desk
* **Contractor (Cargo Owner) Portal:** Post freight manifests specifying cargo type, container specs (e.g., 20ft/40ft Flatbed, Box Truck, Tipper, Tanker), tonnage, cargo valuation, loading bay coordinates, destination, and budget. Track load status in real-time from loading bay to delivery.
* **Middleman (Freight Broker) Deal Desk:** Freight brokers accept contractor requests, assign verified truckers from their proprietary fleets, and automatically lock in their **Brokerage Markup / Commission**. The system enforces data isolation so that Contractors and Truckers cannot communicate offline or bypass the Broker's commission cut.
* **Trucker & Fleet Owner Interface:** Drivers receive trip tenders matching their vehicle specs, review route manifests, upload mandatory transit compliance credentials (hackney permits, Goods-in-Transit [GIT] insurance, roadworthiness certificates), and trigger timestamped trip milestones (*At Loading Bay, Cargo Loaded, In Transit, Border Checkpoint, Arrived at Destination, Offloaded*).

### Module 2: Milestone Haulage Escrow, Mobilization Fuel Advance & 3-Way Split Wallet
* **Milestone Trip Funding (Nigerian Haulage Standard):** Accommodates standard Nigerian haulage cashflow:
  1. **60%–70% Mobilization / Diesel Advance:** Released automatically upon physical loading verification, truck weighbridge slip capture, and signed loading waybill upload.
  2. **30%–40% Delivery Balance:** Locked in secure platform escrow and released upon verified offloading and signed electronic Proof of Delivery (e-POD).
* **Automated 3-Way Split Settlement Engine:** Once the trip is certified complete, the platform settlement engine splits the escrow balance simultaneously between:
  - The **Trucker’s Wallet** (net haulage fee);
  - The **Middleman’s Commission Wallet** (brokerage margin); and
  - The **Platform Service Fee** (royalty percentage).
* **Instant Commercial Bank Disbursements:** Integrates automated NIP bank transfers via Paystack/Moniepoint, allowing drivers and fleet owners to withdraw funds directly into any Nigerian commercial bank account (NUBAN) 24/7.

### Module 3: Digital Waybill & Electronic Proof of Delivery (e-POD)
* **Mobile Waybill & Gate-Pass Capture:** Drivers photograph stamped paper waybills, tally sheets, and customs gate-passes directly within the mobile app.
* **Tamper-Evident e-POD Verification:** Incorporates GPS geolocation tagging and upload timestamps on all delivery documents to eliminate forged waybill disputes.
* **Consignee Digital Sign-Off:** Receiving warehouse managers can sign directly on the driver’s glass or confirm delivery via an automated one-time SMS/WhatsApp delivery authorization PIN.

### Module 4: Logistics Equipment, Spare Parts & Heavy Vehicle Leasing Portal
* **Commercial Spare Parts Storefront:** Categorized e-commerce storefront for selling verified heavy-duty truck components (tyres, batteries, brake shoes, diesel engine blocks, axles, hydraulic jacks, tarpaulins) with multi-vendor vendor merchant dashboards.
* **Heavy Equipment Leasing Engine:** Booking and reservation portal for leasing trucks, low-beds, mobile cranes, forklifts, and earth-moving excavators on daily, weekly, or monthly charters. Includes automated lease agreement generation, caution deposit escrow, and maintenance schedules.
* **Vendor & Dealer Management:** Verified spare-part distributors and fleet leasing operators manage stock levels, pricing, and orders from their dedicated vendor portal.

### Module 5: GPS Checkpoint Tracking, Route Monitoring & Driver Verification
* **Corridor Route Tracking:** Background GPS location telemetry pings active truck positions along highway corridors, rendering live interactive map tracking for Contractors and Middlemen.
* **KYC & Driver Background Screening:** Comprehensive identity verification (NIN, BVN, FRSC Commercial Driver’s License) and vehicle chassis validation to safeguard cargo and prevent transit diversion.
* **Automated Transit Notifications:** Automated SMS and WhatsApp status alerts triggered at major highway milestones and upon arrival at delivery gates.

### Module 6: Enterprise Financial Accounting, Demurrage & Statutory Tax Ledger
* **Haulage Double-Entry Accounting Ledger:** Specialized chart of accounts covering Escrow Liabilities, Fuel Advances, Retainage, Driver Payouts, Brokerage Margins, and Platform Royalty Revenues.
* **Demurrage & Detention Calculation Engine:** Automated computation of demurrage fees for delayed loading or offloading beyond agreed free grace hours (e.g., port holding bay delays or warehouse offloading queues).
* **Statutory Tax Compliance (VAT & WHT):** Automated calculation of 7.5% VAT on platform and brokerage fees, plus 5% Withholding Tax (WHT) deductions with exportable FIRS/NRS-compliant tax deduction credit schedules.
* **Automated Invoicing & Audit Trails:** Dynamic generation of branded PDF freight contracts, waybill manifests, commercial spare parts invoices, equipment lease agreements, and payment advice slips.

### Module 7: Master Operations Center & Dispute Resolution Desk
* **Operations Command Dashboard:** High-level administrative bird’s-eye view monitoring all active transit corridors, pending escrow disbursements, verified driver queues, and equipment lease expiries.
* **Dispute & Shortage Claims Desk:** Structured arbitration workflow for handling cargo transit damage, missing goods, or transit delays before releasing contested escrow funds.
* **100% Immutable System Audit Logs:** Every system action, user login, waybill approval, fund release, and status alteration is permanently recorded with user ID, GPS coordinates, and timestamp.

